<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82632" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περκνός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dusky, dark in colour</i>, of grapes when beginning to
			ripen, or of olives, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.61
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.67
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περκνὴν</span> (prob. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέρκην</span>(
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> . . ἐλάην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.102
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Phil.
			</span></i>) ; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἔχις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mir.</u>
					846b18
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				129
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἰχθύες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Marc.Sid.
					7
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>livid</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VC</u>
				19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., name of a kind of <i>eagle</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰετὸν . . , μόρφνον θηρητῆρ᾽, ὃν καὶ
					περκνὸν καλέουσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					24.316
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Aristarch.
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέρκνον</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				835a2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				260
			</span></i> ; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλάγγος</span>
			 acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				618b23
			</span></i>. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρακνόν</span>, Skt.
				<i>pŕṛśnis</i> 'spotted', OIr.
				<i>erc</i>, Welsh <i>erch</i> 'speckled', 'dusky'.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
